{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/somerset-council-best-value-notice","content_id":"39713268-c83e-428a-8179-9b9191937716","description":"Best Value Notice issued to Somerset Council on 15 July 2026.","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a572af26d6d5c7e2845c967","filename":"Somerset_Council_BVN_letter.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":164818,"filename":"Somerset_Council_BVN_letter.pdf","id":"9394589","isbn":"","number_of_pages":3,"title":"Somerset Council: Best Value Notice","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a572af26d6d5c7e2845c967/Somerset_Council_BVN_letter.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>On 15 July 2026, the Minister for Local Government and Homelessness, Alison McGovern, announced in a written ministerial statement the issuing of a non-statutory best value notice to Somerset Council.</p>\n\n<p>This best value notice is a formal notification that the department has concerns regarding the authority and requests that the authority engages with the department to provide assurance of improvement.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-15T14:06:45Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9394589"],"first_public_at":"2026-07-15T15:06:45.000+01:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"